    plan         build
    regionId     1
",
}
`;

exports[`meili project view > writes an error as text for a human in a terminal 1`] = `
{
  "exitCode": 3,
  "stderr": "✗ You cannot access this project. (project_not_accessible)
  Docs: https://www.meilisearch.com/docs/reference/errors#project_not_accessible
",
